ressida, Rosalinde, Belinda, Desdemona, Cordelina, Ophelia, and Bianca II\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A naming tradition began in 1687\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"a naming tradition begun in 1687\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Voyager 2 discovered three new rings in addition to the \\\"older\\\" eight rings\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"three new rings in addition to the \\\"older\\\" eight rings\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Uranus has a magnetic field tilted at 66 degrees off-axis and off-center\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"a magnetic field tilted at 66 degrees off-axis and off-center\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Voyager 2 found wind speeds in Uranus' atmosphere as high as 450 km/h (72400 meters per hour)\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"The spacecraft found wind speeds in Uranus' atmosphere as high as 450 km/h (72400 meters per hour)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Voyager 2 found evidence of a boiling lake of water some 479 miles (900 kilometers) below the top cloud surface\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"found evidence of a boiling lake of water some 479 miles (900 kilometers) below the top cloud surface\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Uranus' rings were found to be extremely variable in thickness and transparency\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"Its rings were found to be extremely variable in thickness and transparency\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Voyager 2 returned photos of Miranda, Oberon, Ariele, Umbrella, and Titan, five of Uranus' smaller moons\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"Voyager 2 also returned spectacular photos of Miranda, Oberon, Ariele, Umbrella, and Titan, five of Uranus' smaller moons\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"In flying by Miranda at a range of 17.560 miles (28.260 kilometers), Voyager 2 came closest to any object so far in its nearly century-long travels\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"In flying by Miranda at a range of only 17.560 miles (28.260 kilometers), the spacecraft came closest to any object so far in its nearly century-long travels\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Uranus appeared generally featureless\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"Uranus itself appeared generally featureless\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The Challenger accident killed six astronauts during a space shuttle launch\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"the tragic Challenger accident that killed six astronauts during their space shuttle launch Feb. 28, 1986\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The Challenger accident occurred on Feb. 28, 1986\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"the tragic Challenger accident that killed six astronauts during their space shuttle launch Feb. 28, 1986\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":133533,"type":"result","duration_ms":137791,"uuid":"00f1b975-c303-4c8c-9a2c-fec4fd9fa3ae","ttft_stream_ms":5716,"time_to_request_ms":4570,"first_content_frame_ms":5717,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
